352 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (Curd and Butter show the lowest \(most negative\) profit margins, indicating they are the least profitable products. In contrast, Ice Cream and Cheese perform relatively better with higher margins. Retail and Online channels generate higher revenue compared to Wholesale. The revenue vs product value graph shows a strong positive correlation, meaning higher product value directly drives higher revenue.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
353 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (Insight:)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
354 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (This indicates pricing or cost inefficiencies in products like Curd and Butter, leading to consistent losses. At the same time, reliance on Retail and Online channels suggests better profitability opportunities there. Optimizing pricing strategies, reducing production costs, and focusing on high-margin products can significantly improve overall profitability.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
