391 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 228 0 R
/E (Curd shows the most critical reorder urgency with the lowest days remaining, followed by Lassi and Paneer. The expiry risk chart also highlights Curd as having the highest quantity at risk, with Butter and Lassi close behind. Products like Ghee and Cheese have relatively lower urgency and risk.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
